<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 250 mln mark Jan 1998 domestic bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 250 mln mark Jan 1998 domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers GZB and SGZ Banks.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPO (BERLIN) AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    12.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.84    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.75</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
